## 🔍 VALIDACIONES ESPECÍFICAS DEL MÓDULO

### Estructura de Datos Esperada
```typescript
interface Booking {
  id: string;
  propertyId: string;
  property: {
    id: string;
    title: string;
    images: string[];
    location: {
      city: string;
      country: string;
    };
  };
  checkIn: Date | string;
  checkOut: Date | string;
  nights: number;
  guests: {
    adults: number;
    children: number;
    infants: number;
  };
  pricing: {
    basePrice: number;
    nightsTotal: number;
    cleaningFee: number;
    serviceFee: number;
    total: number;
    currency?: string; // EUR por defecto
  };
  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed' | 'active';
  createdAt: Date | string;
  confirmedAt?: Date | string;
  paymentInfo?: {
    method: string;
    status: 'pending' | 'paid' | 'failed' | 'refunded';
    paidAt?: Date | string;
  };
}
```

### Endpoints Esperados
- `GET /api/bookings?page=1&limit=1000` - Obtener todas las reservas
- Requiere: Header `Authorization: Bearer {token}`
- Respuesta esperada: Array de `Booking` o `{ bookings: Booking[] }`

